{"ID":"20240205153835-s50j6pl","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240205153835-s50j6pl","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153835-s50j6pl\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206140431-dtepgi5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240616123533-svyqpwk\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240619101210-gdu3vvd\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:3,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:3\u0026#125;","title":"052蓝实（青黛\u0026amp;板蓝根）","type":"doc","updated":"20240711173206"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206140431-dtepgi5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206140431-dtepgi5","updated":"20240206140435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产福建、河北、云南等地。\n【性状】\t本品为极细的粉末，灰蓝色或深蓝色，质轻，易飞扬，可粘手粘纸。具草腥气，味微酸。\n【性味】\t咸，寒。\n【功效】\t清热，凉血消斑，解毒，清肝泻火，定惊。主治温病热盛，斑疹，吐血咯血，小儿惊痫，疮肿，丹毒，蛇虫咬伤。"}]},{"ID":"20240206140424-tw4j1z5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206140424-tw4j1z5","updated":"20240206140424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206140424-85a98ad.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240619100243-0mvpiqq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240619100243-0mvpiqq","updated":"20240619100243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 570px;","style":"width: 560px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蓝实"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蓝实-20240619100243-0cvmtrr.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 560px;\" parent-style=\"width: 570px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240710145533-m4rtix9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240710145533-m4rtix9","updated":"20240711172438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"菘蓝（北板蓝根）"}]},{"ID":"20240710151140-5g0gudb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240710151140-5g0gudb","updated":"20240710151140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产河南、河北、安徽、江苏、东北等地。\n【性状】\t呈细长圆柱形，长约102030cm，直径3"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8mm。表面浅灰黄色，粗糙，有纵皱纹及横斑痕，并有支根痕，根头部略膨大，顶端有一凹窝，周边有暗绿色的叶柄残基，较粗的根并现密集的疣状突起及轮状排列的灰棕色的叶柄痕。质坚实而脆，断面皮部黄白色至浅棕色，木质部黄色。气微弱，味微甘。\n【性味】\t苦，寒。\n【功效】\t清热，解毒，凉血，利咽。用于温毒发斑；高热头痛；大头瘟疫；舌绛紫暗，烂喉丹痧；丹毒；痄腮；喉痹；疮肿、痈肿；水痘；麻疹；肝炎；流行性感冒，流脑，乙脑，肺炎，神昏吐衄，咽肿，火眼，疮疹。\n【注解】\t“菊花心”：指板蓝根药材横断面皮部黄白色，木部黄色，形似菊花心样。"}]},{"ID":"20240710151140-ul015tu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240710151140-ul015tu","updated":"20240710151140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240205172615-ngmzhf7.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240710151140-smmrbed","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240710151140-smmrbed","updated":"20240710151140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"板蓝根"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/板蓝根-20240205155455-lmk96ww.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240619100313-03urmhj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240619100313-03urmhj","updat